  message: "Fixed + merged (selfh/dev 5fc48bb8ee). select_by_connectivity iterated the seed SET + frontier SET directly, so seed ordering + tie resolution depended on PYTHONHASHSEED (non-deterministic node set/order run-to-run, contradicting spec 'Output reproducibility'). Fixed: seed init, frontier tie-break (sorted -> smallest-id wins on tie), and coverage force-include now iterate sorted; the 4th force-include site is already re-sorted by (-centrality,name). Behavioral evidence: multi-seed subprocess determinism test — RELIABLY RED without the fix (verified: 5 distinct outputs across 6 hash seeds), GREEN with it (identical); sorted() lines covered by 33 in-process select_by_* tests. The centrality-ranked default (post-WI-zulij) was already deterministic. core 100%. Wave-4 projection — LAST item; block complete."  # 572e
